 "description": "<p>Tongue licking, thrusting and vibration arrive together in this rose, and the mode counts read like a combination lock: seven frequencies of licking, five of thrusting, five of vibration. Any triple you dial in runs simultaneously, which is the difference between a toy that has three features and a toy that mixes them.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_3_63aa385a-5b9f-41f5-a77a-291367a4c22f_480x480.jpg?v=1689576709\"></p>\n<p>Solo or partnered, the geometry favors the lazy grip — at 330mm long and 55mm across, the handle clears the body while the working end stays angled where it should, so long sessions do not turn into wrist endurance events.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_6_73eb0647-e5cd-488f-87f9-4e7d1ddda454_480x480.jpg?v=1689576712\"></p>\n<p>The full waterproof shell opens bath play and makes cleaning a rinse job. That, plus the fact that the three motor systems share one body, is the practical case for choosing a triple-function toy over stacking two singles.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_9_480x480.jpg?v=1689576722\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Functions: tongue licking + thrusting + vibration (3-in-1)</li>\n<li>Modes: 7 licking, 5 thrusting, 5 vibration frequencies</li>\n<li>Size: L330 x D55 mm</li>\n<li>Waterproof: fully sealed body</li>\n<li>Ergonomics: angled grip for extended sessions</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_8_480x480.jpg?v=1689576719\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator red\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorred_2_9734cc10-a7d6-49e8-9f85-1136aacdda84_480x480.jpg?v=1689576705\"></p>\n<p>Three motors, one rose, and every combination left to you.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>3-in-1 rose tongue licker with 7 licking, 5 thrusting and 5 vibration frequencies in a fully waterproof 330 mm body.</p>\n",
